; 43-list.kurt

; `list` inspects the exported content retained from loaded theories. With no
; argument, or with `files`, it shows which files are loaded.

load group

list
list files

; Name a loaded theory by its stem or filename to see all of its retained
; declarations and facts. Every entry includes its source line.

list group
list group.kurt

; Put a category first to narrow the output. A category without a source
; lists that category across the whole current knowledge base.

list infix group
list const group.kurt
list theory group
list const
